flowchart LR
  A[Archive files] --> B[Normalize and enrich metadata]
  W[Corpus watcher] -. detects add/edit/delete .-> A
  W --> B
  B --> C[(FTS5)]
  B --> D[(Qdrant)]
  B --> E[(Entity graph)]
