  RF -->|yes| W
  RF -->|no| P[Planner]
  W --> P
  P --> L[Research loop]
  C --> T[Research tools]
  D --> T
  E --> T
  T --> L
  L --> G{Gap critic}
  G -->|missing or contested| L
  G -->|sufficient| R[Authority arbitration]
  R --> S[Cited synthesis]
  L -. activity and reasoning SSE .-> U[Next.js trace]
  S --> API[FastAPI]
  API --> U
